# UC Berkeley EECS: faculty map for hyperactivity outreach

The work, in Avik's words: "hyperactivity is a language & decentralized operating system kernel representing arbitrary processes as knowledge hypergraph interaction under invariants - the graph's data is entirely homotopy type-theoretic proof content, where identical relational structure warrants lossless compression, from the middle, out."

## Calendar (official, Registrar 2026-27 PDF)
- Fall 2026: Thanksgiving Nov 25 (non-instructional) and Nov 26-27 (holiday). **Formal classes end Fri Dec 4.** RRR week Dec 7-11 (most lectures do not meet). Finals Dec 14-18.
  - As of 2026-11-19, the Fall lecture days left are Nov 19-20, Nov 23-24, and Nov 30-Dec 4.
- Spring 2027: instruction begins Tue Jan 19. Holidays Jan 18 and Feb 15. Spring recess Mar 22-26. Formal classes end Fri Apr 30.
